    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226030/extras/19681f0782f51a0aa4b4b4dc42eb891f.avif?t=1727891168\" width=616 height=200 /></span><br><br>Dangerous creatures lurk in the dark and gloomy forests of an abandoned village, ready to attack at any moment. Your task is to find supplies, upgrade your bow and learn how to use the environment to your advantage.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226030/extras/95b7d32c8a7c8ce171e0d605f2ad0a85.poster.avif?t=1727891168\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226030/extras/95b7d32c8a7c8ce171e0d605f2ad0a85.webm?t=1727891168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226030/extras/95b7d32c8a7c8ce171e0d605f2ad0a85.mp4?t=1727891168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Move around the village using the keys W, A, S, D, and be ready for unexpected encounters. Use the left mouse button to shoot. Do not forget to monitor your health level to survive in this dangerous world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226030/extras/fc4004fd88eb150b419d30d63afde1ee.poster.avif?t=1727891168\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226030/extras/fc4004fd88eb150b419d30d63afde1ee.webm?t=1727891168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226030/extras/fc4004fd88eb150b419d30d63afde1ee.mp4?t=1727891168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Your goal is to hold out as long as possible, but be careful, because every step can be the last.<br><br>Features of the game:<br><br>- Mysterious monsters that won't let you relax for a minute.<br>- Gloomy forests and abandoned houses full of dangers.<br>- The ability to upgrade your bow to become stronger.<br>- The need to look for supplies so as not to die.<br>- An atmosphere of horror and tension that will not leave you indifferent.",
