l, because every step can be the last.<br><br>Features of the game:<br><br>- Mysterious monsters that won't let you relax for a minute.<br>- Gloomy forests and abandoned houses full of dangers.<br>- The ability to upgrade your bow to become stronger.<br>- The need to look for supplies so as not to die.<br>- An atmosphere of horror and tension that will not leave you indifferent.",
